		{"id":"1b1e18056cb2e5ff","type":"text","text":"```\nThe important part is this:\n\n```\nMoved to other web server: /tmp/phpFjoLWh ====> /opt/manager/html/katana_php-reverse-shell.php\n```\n\nFirst, start a netcat listener on port 4444. From the `nmap` scan, we saw an open port 8715. Using some guess work and the above message, we can trigger the reverse shell by navigating to (http://192.168.120.155:8715/katana_hell.php):\n```","x":4000,"y":480,"width":607,"height":380,"color":"1"},
